# NOTE: mirrored WordPress assets (public/wp-content, public/wp-includes,
# public/vendor) ARE committed — they act as a reliable fallback so a
# Cloudflare build never fails just because the WP host's bot-challenge blocks
# re-fetching them. `npm run mirror` refreshes them; commit the changes.

